Original text — "Alice's Adventures in Wonderland" by Lewis Carroll (1865)
  Public domain. The English source text comes from Project Gutenberg (ebook #11). The Catalan
  translation and the level adaptations (Prudent / Valent / Temerari), the glossary, the challenges
  and the cards are original work of Robert Potau Nuñez (with Claude Code, Anthropic) and ARE covered
  by the all-rights-reserved notice above.
  (Text original, de domini públic; traducció i adaptacions pròpies.)

Voices — narration audio (audio/)
  Synthesised with Microsoft Azure AI Speech (voices ca-ES-JoanaNeural and ca-ES-EnricNeural),
  under Microsoft's terms for the service. The generated recordings are part of this game.

Music and page-turn sound — generated by code in this game (src/musica.js, src/so-pagina-propi.js);
  no third-party recordings or samples.
